# Added by `vercel link`, broadened deliberately: every .env variant stays out,
# INCLUDING .vercel/.env.* pulls. The one exception is .env.example, which
# documents the shape and must stay in the repo — without the negation below a
# fresh clone would silently lose it.
.env*
!.env.example

